This project is an independent Chromium-based Android browser.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by Geometry OU,
Kiwi Browser, or the original kiwibrowser GitHub account.

Source lineage:
- Chromium (BSD-style), https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src
- Kiwi Browser overlay and patches (BSD-3-Clause / GPL-3.0 depending on repo)

GPL-3.0 material lives only under patches/legacy-kiwi/ (copied from
kiwibrowser/patches and kiwibrowser/chromium_extension_patches). Those files
remain GPL-3.0. Do not mix them into BSD-only trees without reviewing the
license implications.

Do not use the Kiwi Browser name, logo, or package ID (com.kiwibrowser.browser)
on public builds.
